---
import SectionDivider from './SectionDivider.astro';
---
<section class="py-20 lg:py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#eef2f6]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Ratings Block (Left) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-brand-primary text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase block font-display">Tevreden Klanten</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-dark tracking-tight font-display">
          Wij inspireren & helpen onze klanten elke dag.
        </h2>
        <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-sans font-normal">
          Financiële rust begint met het juiste advies. Wij zorgen voor een waterdicht vangnet en de beste hypotheek, zodat jij je kunt richten op wat echt belangrijk is.
        </p>

        <!-- Rating Card -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl max-w-md shadow-md">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-primary font-display">4.9</div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm">Uitstekende Beoordelingen</div>
            <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm mt-0.5">★★★★★</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mt-1 font-sans">Gebaseerd op 250+ reviews</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review Cards Block (Right) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative h-[420px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/40 bg-white/20">
        <!-- Fade overlays for seamless scrolling visual effect -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f3f7fb] to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#f3f7fb] to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
        
        <!-- Scroller container -->
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4 p-4 animate-scroll-y">
          <!-- Slide 1 -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Startershypotheek</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Geweldige service! Duidelijk advies voor onze startershypotheek. Zeer aan te bevelen."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Mark & Chantal</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Moerkapelle</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 2 -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">AOV Verzekering</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Ontzettend goed geholpen met onze AOV. Neemt echt de tijd en legde alles in begrijpelijke taal uit."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Daan V.</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Zevenhuizen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 3 -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Hypotheek Oversluiten</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Spekadvies heeft onze hypotheek overgesloten. Scheelt ons honderden euro's per maand! Heel betrouwbaar."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Hanneke S.</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Zoetermeer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 4 -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Woonverzekering</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Al onze schadeverzekeringen hier ondergebracht. Snel geregeld, goede dekking en één vast aanspreekpunt."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Fam. De Graaf</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Waddinxveen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- DUPLICATE SLIDES FOR SEAMLESS LOOP -->
          
          <!-- Slide 1 Duplicate -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Startershypotheek</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Geweldige service! Duidelijk advies voor onze startershypotheek. Zeer aan te bevelen."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Mark & Chantal</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Moerkapelle</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 2 Duplicate -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">AOV Verzekering</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Ontzettend goed geholpen met onze AOV. Neemt echt de tijd en legde alles in begrijpelijke taal uit."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Daan V.</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Zevenhuizen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 3 Duplicate -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Hypotheek Oversluiten</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Spekadvies heeft onze hypotheek overgesloten. Scheelt ons honderden euro's per maand! Heel betrouwbaar."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Hanneke S.</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Zoetermeer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Slide 4 Duplicate -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all hover:border-brand-primary/30">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Woonverzekering</span>
            </div>
            <p   class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-normal mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              "Al onze schadeverzekeringen hier ondergebracht. Snel geregeld, goede dekking en één vast aanspreekpunt."
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">
              <span>Fam. De Graaf</span>
              <span class="text-brand-accent">Waddinxveen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Stats Counters Row (Insonis Style) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-slate-200/50">
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 animate-fade-in">
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-dark font-display">750+</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Gezinnen Geholpen</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 animate-fade-in">
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#ab7a22] font-display">1200+</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Succesvolle Dossiers</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 animate-fade-in">
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-dark font-display">20+</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Jaar Ervaring</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 animate-fade-in">
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-primary font-display">98%</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Tevreden Klanten</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <SectionDivider fillColor="#ffffff" direction="left-high" />
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes scroll-y {
    0% {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
  }
  .animate-scroll-y {
    animation: scroll-y 25s linear infinite;
  }
  .animate-scroll-y:hover {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
</style>
